+	help
+	  OpenWrt-style admin web UI for the RNSBox router build.
+
+	  A single C++/CGI binary served per-request by uhttpd
+	  (OpenWrt's tiny HTTP server; the web tier keeps ~0 resident
+	  RAM since uhttpd forks the CGI per request), replacing the
+	  former Flask app. No Python is needed for the web tier.
+
